      "data": {
        "block_title": null,
        "block_description": "<div class=\"font-montserrat content\">Join us, either <strong>online</strong> or <strong>onsite</strong>, for a day brimming with lectures, workshops, mentoring, and networking – all included in the <strong>price of a single ticket.</strong> Regardless of your background or expertise, your unique story is a vital thread in the transformative fabric of spHERe.it Conference.</div>",
