      "anchor": "acf-block-65c09eb1eee52",
      "data": {
        "block_description": "<div class=\"font-montserrat content\">Step into the rich history of our event venue! Nestled in the heart of the multifunctional Fabryczna City complex, it occupies the charming historic section, once a vibrant Polmos vodka distillery. The echoes of craftsmanship and tradition infuse the air, setting the stage for an unforgettable experience at this year’s conference.</div>",
